#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gec_property_tax_report.field_account_depreciation_model__rs_form15_property_type_id
msgid ""
"Default property tax type for new assets on this model, for example 3 "
"construction in progress on a no-depreciation model. Set on the asset when "
"it is created; an asset that already has a type keeps it."
